{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52244","headline":"诗（幷序） 五 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"可笑世间人，痴多黠者少。\n不愁死路长，贪着苦烦恼。\n夜眠游鬼界，天晓归人道。\n忽起相罗拽，啾唧索租调。\n贫苦无处得，相接被鞭拷（一作「𢭦」）\n生时有苦痛，不如早死好。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52244.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52244","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}